acceptance_criteria: "Accept npm .tgz and .tar.gz package archives through the public SDK and pm package install; Bound extracted entry count and bytes and reject traversal, escaping links, unsupported roots, and ambiguous manifests; Preserve original archive provenance in managed package metadata; Cover npm and Bun offline temp-workspace installation on POSIX and Windows-safe paths"
