environment: pm-cli 2026.7.31; npm pack tarball; offline fresh workspace
expected_result: "pm package install accepts safe local .tgz and .tar.gz npm package archives, validates a bounded extraction, preserves archive provenance, and behaves consistently through SDK and CLI surfaces."
actual_result: The local source validator requires a directory and rejects a standard npm package archive with Local extension source must be a directory.
